Ctrl+X then y :: Copy image to clipboard
Ctrl+X then o :: Open containing folder
Ctrl+X then e :: Open configured/available image editor
Ctrl+X then i :: Show image dimensions and information
Ctrl+X then w :: Apply wallpaper and matching lock screen''', 'Custom')
keys('''Enter :: Switch image / thumbnail mode
q / Q :: Quit; Q also outputs current file with -o when no marks
h/j/k/l / arrows (thumbnails) :: Move thumbnail selection
h/j/k/l / arrows (image) :: Pan image
n / Space :: Next image
p / Backspace :: Previous image
g / G :: First / last image; a numeric count selects image index
[ / ] :: Jump backward / forward ten images
m / M :: Mark image / mark range from previous mark
Ctrl+M / Ctrl+U :: Invert / clear marks
N / P :: Next / previous marked image
+ / - :: Zoom in / out
= :: 100% zoom; count sets a percentage
w / W / F :: Fit large image without upscaling / fit window / fill window
e / E :: Fit width / height
f / b :: Toggle fullscreen / status bar
r / R (thumbnail) :: Reload image / reload all thumbnails
D :: Remove image from viewer list, not delete file
< / > / ? :: Rotate left 90° / right 90° / 180°
| / _ :: Flip horizontally / vertically
s :: Toggle slideshow; count sets delay
a / A :: Toggle antialiasing / transparency display
